                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "en": "His new work colleague is a native <w>Armenian woman</w> who recently moved to our city."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Молодая <w>армянка</w> прекрасно говорила на нескольких иностранных языках.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "en": "The young <w>Armenian woman</w> spoke several foreign languages fluently."
